# Build context for api_server.Dockerfile (the repo root).
#
# An allowlist: everything is ignored unless it is re-included below, so a new
# file - .env, a key, a local database dump - can never reach the image by
# accident. Secrets come in at run time through env_file in docker-compose.yml.
*

# What the Jarvis brain needs to run
!requirements.txt
!*.py
!plugins/

# ...minus bytecode caches that happen to sit beside the sources
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
